<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" lang="en">

<head>
    <%- include("head", locals) %>
</head>

<body class="preload">
    <div class="content">
        <div id="logo"><%- inliner('assets/images/svg/logo.svg') %></div>
        <div class="center">
            <a class="addBtn" href="<%= connectUrl %>">Add to Discord</a>
        </div>
        <div role="main">
            <section>
                <div>
                    <h1>Taunt Bot</h1>
                    <span class="color-2 ital">Celebrate your victories</span>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <p>
                        Taunt Bot is a Discord bot that plays your custom audio clips on command and when you join a voice channel. Play your victory anthem when you win. Humble yourself with a lose track. Intro taunts play when you connect to voice chat.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section>
                <div id="miniD">
                    <div id="serverlist">
                        <div><%- inliner('assets/images/svg/iconoir/chat-bubble-empty-solid.svg') %></div>
                        <div class="selected background magenta"><%- inliner('assets/images/svg/iconoir/hexagon-dice.svg') %></div>
                        <div class="unread background blurple"><%- inliner('assets/images/svg/iconoir/code.svg') %></div>
                        <div class="background green"><%- inliner('assets/images/svg/iconoir/football-ball.svg') %></div>
                        <div class="background gold"><%- inliner('assets/images/svg/iconoir/palette.svg') %></div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="channellist">
                        <div class="text"><%- inliner('assets/images/svg/iconoir/hashtag.svg') %> welcome</div>
                        <div class="text selected"><%- inliner('assets/images/svg/iconoir/hashtag.svg') %> general</div>
                        <div class="text"><%- inliner('assets/images/svg/iconoir/hashtag.svg') %> rpg</div>
                        <div class="voice">
                            <span class="joined"><%- inliner('assets/images/svg/iconoir/sound-high-solid.svg') %></span> voice
                            <div><%- inliner('assets/images/svg/iconoir/user.svg') %> You</div>
                            <div id="tauntbotvoice"><%- inliner('assets/images/svg/logo.svg') %> Taunt Bot</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="voice"><%- inliner('assets/images/svg/iconoir/sound-high-solid.svg') %> afk</div>
                    </div>
                    <div id="everythingelse">
                        <div id="context">
                            <div id="botheading"><%- inliner('assets/images/svg/logo.svg') %> Taunt Bot</div>
                            <div id="commands">
                                <% (commands || []).forEach(command => { %>
                                    <div class="cmdListing" data-cmd="<%= command.slashCommand.substring(1) %>">
                                        <div class="slash"><%= command.slashCommand %></div>
                                        <div class="description color-2"><%= command.description %></div>
                                    </div>
                                <% }); %>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div id="chattextbox"><span id="chattextboxslash">/</span><span id="chattextboxph" class="color-2">Message #general</span></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section>
                <div>
                    <h2>Getting Started</h2>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <p>If you're a server owner, start by <a href="<%= connectUrl %>">connecting Taunt Bot</a> so your members can use it.</p>
                    <p>Once you're in a guild that has Taunt Bot in it, use the <span class="command">/upload</span> command to upload taunts.</p>
                    <p>While in voice, use the <a href="#commands">corresponding play commands</a> to hear Taunt Bot play your tracks.</p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <% if (stats.server_count > 0 || stats.year_taunts > 0) { %>
            <section>
                <div>
                    <h2>Stats</h2>
                </div>
                <% if (stats.server_count > 0) { %>
                <div>
                    Connected to <%= stats.server_count %> Discord guilds
                </div>
                <% } %>
                <% if (stats.year_taunts > 0) { %>
                <div>
                    <%= stats.year_taunts %> taunts played this year
                </div>
                <% } %>
            </section>
            <% } %>
            <section>
                <div>
                    <h2 id="commands">Commands</h2>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="command">/upload</h3>
                    <p class="color-2">Uploads an audio clip to serve as your taunt. Intro taunts can be up to <%= tauntParameters.intro.maxDurationHumanReadable %> long. Other taunt types' max durations are listed below.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="command">/win</h3>
                    <p class="color-2">Plays your "victory" taunt (max <%= tauntParameters.victory.maxDurationHumanReadable %>)</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="command">/mvp</h3>
                    <p class="color-2">Plays your "mvp" taunt (max <%= tauntParameters.mvp.maxDurationHumanReadable %>)</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="command">/lose</h3>
                    <p class="color-2">Plays your "lose" taunt (max <%= tauntParameters.lose.maxDurationHumanReadable %>)</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="command">/stop</h3>
                    <p class="color-2">Stops taunt playback early</p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section>
                <div>
                    <h2>Privacy</h2>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <p>The only data that is kept is your currently uploaded audio taunts and logs. Delete your taunts using the <span class="command">/delete</span> command.</p>
                    <p>Taunt Bot logs taunt plays (what audio file in which server, statistics).</p>
                    <p>Your data is never shared or sold.</p>
                </div>
            </section>
            <section>
                <div>
                    <h2>Support</h2>
                </div>
                <div>
                    Join <a href="/discord">my Discord Guild</a> for assistance.
                </div>
            </section>
            <section>
                <div>
                    <h2>Source Code</h2>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <p>Taunt Bot is open source, licensed under GPLv3. <a href="https://github.com/CorySanin/tauntbot">Browse the bot source code</a> on GitHub.</p>
                    <p>Available in <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/tauntbot">npm</a> and <a href="https://hub.docker.com/r/corysanin/tauntbot">Docker Hub</a>.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <p>This website is licensed under MIT. <a href="https://github.com/CorySanin/tauntbot-web">Browse the site source code</a> on GitHub.</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    Site and bot developed by <a href="https://sanin.dev/">Cory Sanin</a> AKA <a href="https://whoisworm.com/">WORM</a>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="/assets/js/minid.js?v1" nonce="<%= cspNonce %>" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
